UID:ev_hmm_learning_lunch_slinging_mud_1111-2026-11-11@coast-guide
DTSTAMP:20261111T000000Z
DTSTART:20261111T120000
DTEND:20261111T130000
SUMMARY:Learning Lunch: Slinging Mud\, Alabama folk pottery
DESCRIPTION:Joey Brackner\, Alabama's state folklorist from 1985 until he 
 retired in 2022\, talks about the 19th century pottery makers of Alabama.
  The talk places the potters in the politics of their time\, including en
 slavement\, secession\, Reconstruction and the populist movement. The His
 tory Museum of Mobile hosts the free Learning Lunch series\, and guests a
 re invited to bring their lunch.\nPrice: Free\nArea: Mobile & Baldwin Cou
 nty\nTimes: Wednesday 11/11 · 12:00 PM to 1:00 PM\nChecked against the v
 enue's own page on 2026-10-28\nhttps://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-hmm
 -learning-lunch-slinging-mud-1111.html
LOCATION:History Museum of Mobile\, 111 S. Royal St.\, Mobile\, AL 36602
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-hmm-learning-lunch-slinging-mud
 -1111.html
END:VEVENT
